## Suggested Fix

Add nil check in the `max` function:

```go
func max(a corev1.ResourceList, b ...corev1.ResourceList) corev1.ResourceList {
    result := a.DeepCopy()
    if result == nil {
        result = corev1.ResourceList{}
    }
    for _, other := range b {
        maxResourceList(result, other)
    }
    return result
}
```

